<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="x-ua-compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <meta name="description" content="Sichere Videokonferenzen mit Jitsi Admin – modern, leistungsstark, datenschutzkonform.">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>Jitsi Admin | Secure Video Collaboration</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    {{ encore_entry_link_tags('startpage') }}
    {{ include('base/__matomo.html.twig') }}

    <meta property="og:title" content="Jitsi Admin – Hochsichere Videokonferenzen"/>
    <meta property="og:description" content="Moderne Videocollaboration mit DSGVO-konformer Infrastruktur, Zugangskontrolle und Enterprise-Features."/>
    <meta property="og:url" content="{{ absolute_url(path('index')) }}"/>
    <meta property="og:image" content="{{ absolute_url(asset('logo.png')) }}"/>

    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Jitsi Admin – Hochsichere Videokonferenzen">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Sicher, schnell, modern: Videokonferenzen der nächsten Generation.">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ absolute_url(asset('logo.png')) }}">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #060816;
            --surface: rgba(16, 19, 44, 0.68);
            --surface-border: rgba(140, 166, 255, 0.25);
            --text: #ecf0ff;
            --muted: #b9c3f6;
            --brand-a: #6ea8ff;
            --brand-b: #7a5cff;
            --brand-c: #2af4d0;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.35), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(42, 244, 208, 0.2), transparent 27%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 65% 75%, rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.2), transparent 34%),
                var(--bg);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .shell {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 24px 20px 60px;
        }

        .topbar {
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            background: rgba(7, 10, 27, 0.65);
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 18px;
            z-index: 20;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.35);
        }

        .topbar-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .topbar a,
        .cta,
        .cta-secondary {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .topbar-links a {
            font-weight: 500;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .cta,
        .cta-secondary {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            transition: all .2s ease;
        }

        .cta {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--brand-a), var(--brand-b));
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(70, 86, 255, 0.35);
        }

        .cta-secondary {
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            background: rgba(16, 19, 44, 0.5);
        }

        .hero {
            margin-top: 38px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
        }

        .hero-copy {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: var(--brand-c);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.09em;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem);
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 16ch;
        }

        .hero-copy p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            max-width: 60ch;
            margin: 20px 0 28px;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .hero-metrics {
            padding: 22px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .metric {
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(6, 9, 23, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(140, 166, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .metric-value {
            font-size: 1.95rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .grid {
            margin-top: 24px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .feature p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 42px 0 14px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
        }

        .banner {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(12, 18, 45, 0.82), rgba(31, 19, 63, 0.82));
            border: 1px solid rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.45);
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 18px;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .banner p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 68ch;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 34px;
            color: #8f9ad2;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 980px) {
            .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .topbar { position: static; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
    <nav class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
            <img src="{{ asset('logo.png') }}" alt="Jitsi Admin Logo">
            <span>Jitsi Admin Secure Core</span>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-links">
            <a href="#security">Security</a>
            <a href="#platform">Plattform</a>
            <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="card hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">Inspired by next-gen collaboration portals like meetling.de</div>
            <h1>Die ultramoderne Kommandozentrale für hochsichere Videokonferenzen.</h1>
            <p>
                Jitsi Admin verbindet ein futuristisches User-Erlebnis mit kompromissloser Sicherheit:
                Zugangssteuerung, Teilnehmer-Management, DSGVO-konforme Prozesse und skalierbare Infrastruktur
                für Organisationen, Behörden und Unternehmen.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a class="cta" href="{{ path('dashboard') }}">Jetzt einloggen</a>
                <a class="cta-secondary" href="{{ path('register_keycloak') }}">Account erstellen</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="card hero-metrics">
            <div class="metric">
                <div class="metric-value">{{ user|length }}</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Verifizierte Nutzer</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
                <div class="metric-value">{{ server|length }}</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Sicher angebundene Server</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
                <div class="metric-value">{{ rooms|length }}</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Geschützte Konferenzräume</div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </section>

    <h2 id="platform" class="section-title">Plattform-Highlights</h2>
    <section class="grid">
        <article class="card feature" id="security">
            <h3>Zero-Trust Zugriff</h3>
            <p>Rollen, Einladungen, Warteraum-Logik und granular definierte Rechte schützen vertrauliche Meetings bereits vor dem Betreten.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card feature">
            <h3>Enterprise-Ready Scheduling</h3>
            <p>Konferenzen planen, Teilnehmerströme steuern und wiederkehrende Meetings orchestrieren – alles in einer klaren Oberfläche.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card feature">
            <h3>Datensouveränität by Design</h3>
            <p>Konzipiert für Organisationen, die volle Kontrolle über Infrastruktur, Datenflüsse und Compliance-Anforderungen benötigen.</p>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="banner" id="kontakt">
        <div>
            <strong>Fokus: Security + UX + Performance</strong>
            <p>Diese Startseite setzt bewusst ein neues, hochwertiges Design-Statement: dunkler Premium-Look, klare Informationsarchitektur und ein modernes Security-Narrativ für digitale Meetings auf höchstem Niveau.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/H2-invent/jitsi-admin" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Source ansehen</a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        Jitsi Admin – modernisiert für sichere Videokonferenzen der nächsten Generation.
    </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
